  "query_preview": "..\n(Tuesday through next Sunday)\nIssued at 121 PM CDT Sun May 31 2026\n\nTuesday the ridge will begin to break down. Deeper moisture will \nsurge into the region increasing PW values. The increased moisture \nand the weakening subsidence will allow showers and thunderstorms to \nform during the afternoon and evening starting Tuesday and then each \nafternoon and evening through Saturday. This pattern is looking very \nsummer-like. It should be ordinary convection with only moderate \nrainfall and wind gusts. Thursday and Friday look to have the best \nchances for convection.",
